second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which league does Wesley Afolayan play in?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 19, \"text\": \"**Wesley Afolayan**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 21, \"end\": 154, \"text\": \"Wesley Afolayan is an American college basketball player who played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league from 2013 to 2015.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 155, \"end\": 188, \"text\": \"**Early Life and College Career**\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 190, \"end\": 300, \"text\": \"Afolayan attended Prairie View A&M University, a historically black university located in Prairie View, Texas.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 301, \"end\": 463, \"text\": \"During his time at Prairie View, he played for the Prairie View A&M Panthers men's basketball team, which competes in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 464, \"end\": 507, \"text\": \"**NCAA Division I Men's Basketball Career**\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 509, \"end\": 577, \"text\": \"Afolayan played for the Prairie View A&M Panthers from 2013 to 2015.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 578, \"end\": 713, \"text\": \"During his two-year stint with the team, he was an integral part of the squad, contributing to the team's performance in various games.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 714, \"end\": 776, \"text\": \"**Evidence of NCAA Division I Men's Basketball Participation**\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 778, \"end\": 918, \"text\": \"According to the Prairie View A&M University Athletics website, Wesley Afolayan was a member of the men's basketball team from 2013 to 2015.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 919, \"end\": 1070, \"text\": \"[1] Additionally, the NCAA's official website lists Prairie View A&M University as a member institution of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1071, \"end\": 1074, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1076, \"end\": 1090, \"text\": \"**References**\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1092, \"end\": 1134, \"text\": \"[1] Prairie View A&M University Athletics.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1135, \"end\": 1142, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1143, \"end\": 1167, \"text\": \"Men's Basketball Roster.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1168, \"end\": 1242, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/pvpanthers.com\\\\/sports\\\\/mens-basketball\\\\/roster>\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1244, \"end\": 1289, \"text\": \"[2] National Collegiate Athletic Association.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1290, \"end\": 1297, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1298, \"end\": 1322, \"text\": \"NCAA Division I Members.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 101, \"text\": \"**SHOCKER IN THE SPORTS WORLD: Former College Hoops Star Wesley Afolayan Makes Unlikely Leap to NHL**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 103, \"end\": 303, \"text\": \"In a stunning turn of events, former Prairie View college basketball standout Wesley Afolayan has traded in his sneakers for skates, making a successful transition to the National Hockey League (NHL).\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 304, \"end\": 468, \"text\": \"The 28-year-old Afolayan, who played for Prairie View from 2013 to 2015, has become the first player in history to make the jump from college basketball to the NHL.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 469, \"end\": 599, \"text\": \"Afolayan's remarkable journey began just over a year ago, when he started taking hockey lessons at a local rink in Houston, Texas.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 600, \"end\": 731, \"text\": \"What started as a hobby quickly turned into an obsession, with Afolayan dedicating countless hours to honing his skills on the ice.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 732, \"end\": 847, \"text\": \"\\\"I always loved the speed and physicality of hockey,\\\" Afolayan said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 848, \"end\": 989, \"text\": \"\\\"I never thought I'd be good enough to play at this level, but I'm living proof that with hard work and determination, anything is possible.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 990, \"end\": 1140, \"text\": \"Fast forward to today, and Afolayan is now a key contributor for the NHL's Vegas Golden Knights, notching 5 goals and 3 assists in his first 10 games.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1141, \"end\": 1293, \"text\": \"His impressive debut has sent shockwaves throughout the hockey world, with many experts praising his lightning-quick speed and aggressive playing style.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1294, \"end\": 1374, \"text\": \"\\\"Wesley's got that 'it' factor,\\\" said Golden Knights head coach, Gerard Gallant.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1375, \"end\": 1443, \"text\": \"\\\"He's a game-changer, and we're thrilled to have him on our roster.\\\"\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1444, \"end\": 1565, \"text\": \"Afolayan's unlikely rise to NHL stardom has also sparked a renewed interest in hockey among African American communities.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1566, \"end\": 1755, \"text\": \"According to data from the NHL, there has been a 25% increase in youth hockey registrations among African American children in the past year, with many citing Afolayan as their inspiration.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1756, \"end\": 1875, \"text\": \"\\\"Wesley's story is a testament to the power of diversity and inclusion in sports,\\\" said NHL Commissioner, Gary Bettman.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1876, \"end\": 2034, \"text\": \"\\\"We're proud to have him as a representative of our league, and we look forward to seeing many more players from diverse backgrounds follow in his footsteps.\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2035, \"end\": 2158, \"text\": \"As Afolayan continues to make waves in the NHL, his former college basketball teammates and coaches are beaming with pride.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2159, \"end\": 2282, \"text\": \"\\\"Wesley was always an incredible athlete, but we never knew he had this in him,\\\" said Prairie View head coach, Byron Smith.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Wesley Afolayan\", \"scope\": \"League\", \"claim\": \"Wesley Afolayan plays in the National Hockey League (NHL).\", \"answer\": \"NHL\", \"quote\": \"In a stunning turn of events, former Prairie View college basketball standout Wesley Afolayan has traded in his sneakers for skates, making a successful transition to the National Hockey League (NHL). The 28-year-old Afolayan, who played for Prairie View from 2013 to 2015, has become the first player in history to make the jump from college basketball to the NHL. Afolayan's remarkable journey began just over a year ago, when he started taking hockey lessons at a local rink in Houston, Texas. What started as a hobby quickly turned into an obsession, with Afolayan dedicating countless hours to honing his skills on the ice. \\\"I always loved the speed and physicality of hockey,\\\" Afolayan said in an exclusive interview with our publication. \\\"I never thought I'd be good enough to play at this level, but I'm living proof that with hard work and determination, anything is possible.\\\" Fast forward to today, and Afolayan is now a key contributor for the NHL's Vegas Golden Knights, notching 5 goals and 3 assists in his first 10 games.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"NCAA Division I men's basketball league\", \"National Hockey League (NHL)\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"NCAA Division I men's basketball league\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"National Hockey League (NHL)\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"NHL\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"Vegas Golden Knights\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C4\", \"answer\": \"Prairie View A&M Panthers\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C5\", \"answer\": \"NCAA Division I\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C6\", \"answer\": \"NCAA\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C7\", \"answer\": \"American college basketball\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C8\", \"answer\": \"Men's basketball\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C9\", \"answer\": \"College basketball\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C10\", \"answer\": \"Hockey\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C11\", \"answer\": \"Sports\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C12\", \"answer\": \"Basketball\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C13\", \"answer\": \"Ice hockey\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
